      <details class="navigator"><summary>Part navigator · <span id="assigned-count">000</span> assigned</summary><section class="panel overview" aria-label="128-part overview"><div class="panel-header"><div class="panel-title">${_(`grid`)}Part overview</div><span class="chip">8 PORTS × 16 CH</span></div><div class="overview-caption">Select a part to shape its sound. Numbers are MIDI channels.</div><div class="parts-grid" id="parts-grid"></div><div class="grid-legend"><span><i class="legend-box"></i>Selected</span><span><i class="legend-dot"></i>Bank assigned</span><span>All 128 parts are independent</span></div></section></details>
